#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:3
#: 25c9ad1537ff4ec383760b2c874b04fb
msgid "分支合并组（Branch Merge Group）"
msgstr "Branch Merge Group"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:5
#: 5f4360bee90246468940234457b0529b
msgid "**分类：** 工作流"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:7
#: 3b72cda01500472e9413cd36b66e6a72
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:9
#: d75d6b0cdb8c462e998092b416dcda78
msgid ""
"把共享同一输入的多张卡片装进一个容器里，依次运行后汇总输出。适合“同一个母相结"
"构既要生成表面，又要生成体相空位”这类独立分支场景。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:11
#: 8896f6eee376436892357ab8f0c0750b
msgid ""
"这里的“分支”是**数据语义**，不是同时占用多个线程：每张启用的子卡都读取同一份"
"组输入，子卡按界面顺序逐张运行，前一张子卡的输出不会成为下一张子卡的输入。全"
"部成功后，组把各分支输出合并为一个数据集。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:13
#: 988b7b59be114a83be38f6c4d2b069b6
msgid ""
"**不是做什么的：** 不是过滤器、不是生成卡、不支持组内卡片之间的串行依赖。串行"
"依赖请放在组外顺序连接。"
msgstr ""
"**What it is not:** A Card Group is neither a filter nor a generator, and it "
"does not support serial dependencies between child cards. Put dependent "
"cards in sequence outside the group."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:15
#: 5cf30b6d149c4338ada96950cb9310c5
msgid "工作原理"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:17
#: b35d8440d5e24ffca6952b4e8371afc7
msgid ""
"设组输入为数据集 $\\mathcal D$，启用的子卡操作为 $O_1,\\ldots,O_m$。分支合并"
"的结果是"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:20
#: 2d8f211836ec4cb699f28c8c8951675f
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{merge}}=\n"
"O_1(\\mathcal D)\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\cdots\\mathbin{\\Vert}O_m(\\mathcal D),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:25
#: 7c4a03fb1a8a42d89c16421eb639de7d
msgid ""
"其中 $\\Vert$ 表示按分支顺序拼接；它不是 $O_m(\\cdots O_2(O_1(\\mathcal D)))"
"$。若配置了一张后置过滤卡 $F$，最终输出才是 $F(\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{merge}})"
"$。因此子卡之间不能依赖前一张子卡生成的标签、坐标或元素。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:29
#: 2fbe92c4a38a4f019a29c9a5ab975df0
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:31
#: 5d2dc8879839433d8540b017882bc461
msgid "场景：一份母相结构要同时生成表面 slab 和体相空位"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: Generate surface slabs and bulk vacancies from one parent structure"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:33
#: be0e15545b684989b0f4ea1f8c7f30ed
msgid ""
"你已经弛豫好一个 Ni 超胞，想同时做两件事：① 切不同取向的表面 slab；② 在体相内"
"随机挖空位。两条路径互不依赖，但你不想分两次导数据。"
msgstr ""
"A relaxed Ni supercell must follow two independent paths: cut surface slabs "
"with several orientations and create random bulk vacancies. A Card Group "
"avoids importing the same data twice."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:35
#: ab247cbd16da45038206051bc87e383b
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Ni 4×4×4 超胞"
msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed 4×4×4 Ni supercell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:37
#: 4a4ae03cf449489b8a90f2c463823d8e
msgid ""
"**目标：** 把 `Random Slab` 和 `Random Vacancy` 放入同一组，共享输入，生成两"
"个独立分支并统一导出"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:39
#: 7c31be27adf04d07b456003f9e2b4698
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:40
#: 24db1696583b4723a41aa0b3e31df8b7
msgid "将 `Random Slab` 卡片拖入组内，配置好 slab 参数"
msgstr "Drag `Random Slab` into the group and configure its slab parameters."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:41
#: d850ed88939b47bf86015ade21638cb4
msgid "将 `Random Vacancy` 卡片拖入组内，配置好空位规则"
msgstr "Drag `Random Vacancy` into the group and configure its vacancy rules."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:42
#: c69188afa467418599de56d6b9429899
msgid "`card_list` 自动维护为 `[{RandomSlabCard...}, {RandomVacancyCard...}]`"
msgstr ""
"`card_list` is maintained automatically as `[{RandomSlabCard...}, "
"{RandomVacancyCard...}]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:44
#: 1e1cbbcd796d4088a4dbf6fb8b4f1e2f
msgid ""
"**输出：** 两个分支的并集——一批不同取向表面 slab + 一批不同空位结构，各自带独"
"立标签"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** The union of both branches: surface slabs with several "
"orientations and a set of vacancy structures, each carrying its own "
"provenance label."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:46
#: 4b8fc96b50d14c3dbb6af90a529619ea
msgid ""
"**怎么验证：** 抽查输出，确认有明确不同标签来源（`Slab(...)` vs "
"`Vac(...)`）。如果只有一种标签，检查组内卡片是否都勾选了 `check_state`。"
msgstr ""
"**How to verify it:** Inspect a sample and confirm distinct labels such as "
"`Slab(...)` and `Vac(...)`. If only one label appears, confirm that "
"`check_state` is enabled for every child card."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:48
#: 7b8323c593b24696b34d8b84f151c562
msgid "什么时候用、什么时候不用"
msgstr "When to use a Card Group"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:50
#: c9b9cc158416468ebec3b567a8fb5a58
msgid "**用：**"
msgstr "**Use it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:51
#: 2fc5cd26678544b4a998e773c5a63fd6
msgid "同一输入需要分别喂给多张彼此无依赖的卡片"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:52
#: 19d51b56dc9a4232b49a42b5fbf50af8
msgid "多条分支需要统一启停和导出"
msgstr "Several branches should be enabled, disabled, and exported together."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:54
#: 932c0839e0c5495f98965376a2b9908c
msgid "**不用：**"
msgstr "**Do not use it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:55
#: 431ebc9ed3dd41948bae85de63a6b443
msgid "卡片之间有前后依赖（A 的输出是 B 的输入）→ 放在组外串行连接"
msgstr ""
"Cards have a dependency (B consumes A's output); connect them serially "
"outside the group."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:56
#: 0af252d0eab14961860d2a9e83befd7a
msgid "只需要单张卡 → 不需要组"
msgstr "Only one card is needed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:58
#: 3f7fbdfe0d7f47de85b777b5abc1c5c5
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:60
#: c4d573251afc4d9c8a07ef5438257068
msgid "`card_list`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:62
#: bbcc6af4922241c584bda50be31333cf
msgid ""
"组内的子卡片列表，由界面拖入操作自动维护，不需要你手动编辑。每项是一个完整的"
"卡片配置 dict（含 `class`、`check_state`、`params` 等字段）。界面中的顺序决定"
"实际运行顺序，但不构成数据依赖。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:64
#: fe8c48718d1f444bb6a06761cdb5b126
msgid ""
"关闭整个组时，组会直接把输入传给下游，不会改动各子卡原本的启用状态；重新开启"
"组后，之前选择的分支仍会保留。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:66
#: d2f9103d7e6f4e37972037b26ec57d0c
msgid "`filter_card`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:68
#: bcc650cfa730431d806942603861ba18
msgid ""
"dict 或 null，默认 null。选填：在组内末尾挂一张过滤卡（如 `FPS Filter`），对"
"所有分支合并后的结果做统一筛选。一个组只允许一张后置过滤卡；若已有过滤卡，应"
"先关闭或移走，再拖入另一张。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:70
#: 4cd58f27cfc445e2abdd98eb282e9c1a
msgid "后置过滤结果就是最终组输出，也会成为下游卡片的输入。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:72
#: 895859d002c54a70bd208556950107bb
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:74
#: 8f7d6a98e4f54d68a5fdd05d311d654b
msgid "空容器（只需要拖入卡片）"
msgstr "Empty container; drag cards into it in the interface"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:75
#: 6452ab9192fa455f8df7096a1e849b37
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CardGroup\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"card_list\": [],\n"
"  \"filter_card\": null\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:84
#: e253905a554948ebab6609430703574b
msgid "带组内过滤（先生成独立分支，再 FPS 筛）"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:85
#: 63b76d9d1335459a814072e3cd1427a6
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CardGroup\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"card_list\": [\n"
"    {\"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\", \"check_state\": true, \"params\": {}},\n"
"    {\"class\": \"RandomVacancyCard\", \"check_state\": true, \"params\": "
"{}}\n"
"  ],\n"
"  \"filter_card\": {\n"
"    \"class\": \"FPSFilterDataCard\",\n"
"    \"check_state\": true,\n"
"    \"params\": {\n"
"      \"nep_path\": \"path/to/nep.txt\",\n"
"      \"n_samples\": 50,\n"
"      \"min_distance\": 0.0,\n"
"      \"backend\": \"auto\",\n"
"      \"chunk_max_atoms\": 100000,\n"
"      \"strategy\": \"global\",\n"
"      \"existing_dataset_path\": \"\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:109
#: ceffa11e06824e4a8f26516f82f24dd3
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:111
#: 0069463dc209409a9839092cc8c9dc91
msgid ""
"`Card Group(Random Slab, Insert Defect)` → `FPS Filter`：从同一输入生成表面与"
"缺陷分支 → 组外统一筛选"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:112
#: 86477402c5514c799c59f30b162c85ee
msgid ""
"`Card Group(Atomic Perturb, Lattice Perturb)` → export：同一输入同时补充坐标"
"噪声+晶格噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Card Group(Atomic Perturb, Lattice Perturb)` -> export: add coordinate "
"noise and lattice noise as separate branches from the same input"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:113
#: bde5d5adb9394bd8918b77de2dd037d8
msgid ""
"如果两条分支有严格依赖，拆回顶层串行：`Super Cell → Random Slab → Insert "
"Defect`"
msgstr ""
"When branches have a strict dependency, use a top-level serial chain: `Super "
"Cell -> Random Slab -> Insert Defect`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:115
#: 81e4f523d2a940f5815ae254fa982c2e
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:117
#: 97be3c5cf1e44f4a9f9dbbf1166f4dc4
msgid ""
"**组输出为空。** 检查组内每张子卡片是否勾选了 `check_state`、各自配置是否合"
"法。任一启用子卡失败时，组会清空已收集的部分结果，停止后续分支并把失败传给工"
"作流。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:119
#: 8b1f0633309f498d982f92cea2b3aa8b
msgid ""
"**分支结果混在一起分不清。** 检查每张子卡片是否产出了不同的 `Config_type` 标"
"签。组本身不区分来源——区分靠子卡片的标签。"
msgstr ""
"**Branch results cannot be distinguished.** Confirm that each child produces "
"a distinct `Config_type`. The group does not add provenance; it relies on "
"child-card labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:121
#: 7d6a8038d53d4e33a56de0adfab3b963
msgid ""
"**组内过滤卡把结果全筛掉了。** `filter_card` 的过滤阈值可能过严，例如几何阈值"
"不适合当前体系，或 FPS 描述符距离阈值导致提前停止。先看过滤卡自己的预览和错误"
"信息，再调整参数。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:123
#: 88924ab54ae648a8be788c6efca6e0ad
msgid ""
"**想在组内串行。** 不支持。组内所有卡片共享同一输入，是彼此独立的分支。串行依"
"赖请拆到组外。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:125
#: d4302f11abc8474e945e051cd16734b5
msgid ""
"这里的“串行依赖”是指 A 的输出作为 B 的输入。分支合并组虽然为了资源安全逐张执"
"行子卡，但数据上仍是独立分支。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:127
#: bec4e85028de4c3abf65dcc73297fa5c
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:129
#: 8ba930fb3fab4fc985705109a6e1527d
msgid "该卡片本身不写入 `Config_type` 标签。标签由组内子卡片各自产生。"
msgstr ""
"Card Group itself does not write a `Config_type`; each child card supplies "
"its own label."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:131
#: db159750eb9748c6ba900e92c9a0184b
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:133
#: ffcc60fe8d1446caa21cc2de7df52f52
msgid "无自身随机性。可复现性取决于组内子卡片的 seed 配置。"
msgstr ""
"Card Group has no randomness of its own. Reproducibility depends on the seed "
"settings of its child cards."

#~ msgid "卡片组（Card Group）"
#~ msgstr "Card Group"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "把共享同一输入的多张卡片装进一个容器里，并行执行后汇总输出。适合\"同一个母"
#~ "相结构既要走表面链又要走缺陷链\"这种分支场景。组内卡片互不依赖、各自独立读"
#~ "取组输入。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Place several independent cards that share one input in a container, run "
#~ "them as parallel branches, and merge their outputs. This is useful when "
#~ "the same parent structure must feed both a surface branch and a defect "
#~ "branch. Every card in the group reads the group input independently."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**目标：** 把 `Random Slab` 和 `Random Vacancy` 放入同一组，共享输入，并行"
#~ "生成两个分支，统一导出"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Objective:** Put `Random Slab` and `Random Vacancy` in one group, share "
#~ "the input, run both branches, and export their combined outputs."

#~ msgid "同一输入需要同时喂给多张彼此无依赖的卡片"
#~ msgstr "One input must feed several independent cards."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "组内的子卡片列表，由界面拖入操作自动维护，不需要你手动编辑。每项是一个完整"
#~ "的卡片配置 dict（含 class、check_state、params 等字段），子卡片共享组输"
#~ "入、各自独立运行。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The interface maintains the child-card list as cards are dragged into the "
#~ "group. Do not edit it manually. Each item is a complete card "
#~ "configuration dictionary containing fields such as class, check_state, "
#~ "and params. Child cards share the group input and run independently."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "dict 或 null，默认 null。选填：在组内末尾挂一张过滤卡（如 `FPS Filter`），"
#~ "对并行生成的汇总结果做统一筛选。留 null 表示不启用组内过滤。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`dict` or `null`, default `null`. Optionally attach a filter such as `FPS "
#~ "Filter` to the end of the group to filter the merged branch outputs. "
#~ "Leave it `null` to disable in-group filtering."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "组内过滤只作用于组输出，不进入下游卡片的输入流。如果你需要在组外继续处理，"
#~ "把过滤卡串在组后。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "An in-group filter acts only on group output. To continue processing in "
#~ "the top-level dataflow, place the filter after the group instead."

#~ msgid "带组内过滤（先并行生成，再 FPS 筛）"
#~ msgstr "Parallel generation followed by an in-group FPS filter"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Card Group(Random Slab, Insert Defect)` → `FPS Filter`：并行生成表面+缺"
#~ "陷 → 组外统一筛选"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Card Group(Random Slab, Insert Defect)` -> `FPS Filter`: generate "
#~ "surfaces and defects in parallel, then filter the merged output outside "
#~ "the group"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**组输出为空。** 检查组内每张子卡片是否勾选了 `check_state`、各自配置是否"
#~ "合法。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The group output is empty.** Confirm that `check_state` is enabled on "
#~ "every child and that each child configuration is valid."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**组内过滤卡把结果全筛掉了。** `filter_card` 的过滤参数可能过严（如 "
#~ "`n_samples` 设太大但输入很少）。先调松过滤参数，或去掉组内过滤改为组外过"
#~ "滤。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The in-group filter removed everything.** Its parameters may be too "
#~ "restrictive. Relax them, or remove `filter_card` and apply a top-level "
#~ "filter where the intermediate output can be inspected."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**想在组内串行。** 不支持。组内所有卡片共享同一输入、并行执行。串行依赖请"
#~ "拆到组外。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**A serial chain is needed inside the group.** This is unsupported. All "
#~ "child cards share one input and run as parallel branches; move serial "
#~ "dependencies outside."
